==Battleground==
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**2 [[Ange Lackey]]s spawn, delay 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Mini White Cyclone]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**8 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Newtone]] to keep The Face and Mini White Cyclone in their place while cats like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]] whittle them down. The Ange Lackeys are the main concern. Newtone and [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] will be an excellent source of damage to them, while heavy hitters like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] also are an excellent source of burst damage. You can try and use [[Fortune Teller Cat (Rare Cat)|Doctor Cat]] to knock the Mini White Cyclones and The Face out of Ange Lackey's blind spot so you can damage him more easily.

==Trivia==
*Golden Gate Menma is named after the [[wikipedia:Golden Gate Bridge|Golden Gate Bridge]] and [[wikipedia:Menma|menma]], a condiment consisting of bamboo shoots fermented in lactic acid.

